WEBVTT

00:00:28.231 --> 00:00:30.976
I started thinking about my father
and my grandfather

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.063
and my great-grandfather,

00:00:33.087 --> 00:00:34.755
and I realized

00:00:34.779 --> 00:00:39.025
that I had all of these Teds
going through my bloodstream --

00:00:39.049 --> 00:00:40.447
(Laughter)

00:00:40.471 --> 00:00:43.976
that I had to consider this "my element."

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.377
So, who am I?

00:00:46.401 --> 00:00:50.030
Chris kind of mentioned I started
a company with my husband.

00:00:50.054 --> 00:00:52.473
We have about 125 people internationally.

00:00:52.497 --> 00:00:53.976
If you looked in the book,

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.584
you saw this ...

00:00:55.608 --> 00:00:56.877
(Laughter)

00:00:56.901 --> 00:01:00.173
which I really was appalled by.